Package: condathis
Title: Run Any CLI Tool in a 'Conda' Environment
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lucio", "Queiroz", , "luciorqueiroz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6090-1834")),
    person("Claudio", "Zanettini", , "claudio.zanettini@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "ctb"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5043-8033"))
  )
Description: Runs command line interface (CLI) tools in isolated and
    reproducible 'Conda' environments from R. Environments are created and
    managed with 'micromamba', which is downloaded when no usable copy is
    found. Commands run with their environment activated, alone or as
    pipelines connected by pipes. Other packages can provide other tools
    to create and run environments.
